# Implementation Plan: Centralized Universal Settings System

We will create a centralized **Settings View & Module** (`/settings`) accessible via the sidebar for ALL user roles (Patient, Doctor, Admin, SuperAdmin) adhering to our single-brand navy palette (`#243B63` / `#1C2B4F`) and Lucide outline vector icons.

---

## ⚙️ 1. Header Cleanup & Navigation Integration
1. **Header Cleanup**:
   - Remove sound icon toggle from `header.component.html` (relocating it cleanly to Settings -> Notifications & Sound).

2. **Sidebar Navigation**:
   - Add **"Settings"** nav item (`<lucide-icon name="settings">`) for all 4 user roles in `sidebar.component.html`.

---

## 🎨 2. Settings View Component & Sub-Sections

### A. 🔔 Notifications & Sound (All Users)
- **Notification Sound Master Toggle**: Enable/Disable audio alerts (persisted in LocalStorage).
- **Sound Tone Selector**: Dropdown to select notification chime tone (Default Chime / Medical Bell).
- **Per-Channel Toggles**: Email Alerts, SMS Notifications, In-App Push Badges.

### B. 🔒 Account & Security (All Users)
- **Change Password**: Relocated from Profile section into a clean security form.
- **Active Session Overview**: Displays current logged-in role & active session details.

### C. 🎨 Appearance & Display (All Users)
- **Theme Mode Selector**: Light Mode ↔ Dark Mode ↔ System Default.
- **Font Size & Accessibility**: Normal ↔ Large font scaling preference.

### D. 🧑‍⚕️ / 👨‍⚕️ Role-Specific Settings
- **Patient Settings**:
  - Default Consultation Mode Preference (In-Person vs. Video Consultation).
- **Doctor Settings**:
  - Auto-Accept Appointment Requests toggle (manual review vs instant confirm).
  - Default Appointment Slot Duration (15 / 20 / 30 mins).
- **Admin / SuperAdmin Settings**:
  - Verification Queue Alert Preferences (Notify on new doctor/clinic registration).

